    "limits": "The abstraction admits only fixed DIAL/SENDTO/VIEW actions. It excludes URI parser completeness, all Android resolver behavior, physical handlers, WebView gesture attestation, popup-ticket provenance and full Capacitor lifecycle. No call or message send authority is modeled or exercised."
